1
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,735
‎I am coming to you now.

2
00:00:27,444 --> 00:00:30,196
‎Please come meet me, my dear husband.

3
00:00:34,909 --> 00:00:36,036
‎My lady!

4
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:37,829
‎My lady!

5
00:00:39,122 --> 00:00:39,956
‎Oh, good heavens.

6
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:42,250
‎What are you doing over there?

7
00:00:42,333 --> 00:00:43,293
‎It's dangerous!

8
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:45,086
‎I said it's dangerous!

9
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:47,756
‎Madam!

10
00:00:49,716 --> 00:00:51,176
‎Come here! Quickly!

11
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:56,681
‎Eun-sil.

12
00:00:58,641 --> 00:00:59,476
‎Let's go.

13
00:01:00,852 --> 00:01:01,770
‎My lady.

14
00:01:10,278 --> 00:01:11,154
‎No, wait.

15
00:01:41,518 --> 00:01:42,519
‎Well, I…

16
00:02:02,831 --> 00:02:04,249
‎"An Hui-yeon."

17
00:02:15,718 --> 00:02:21,349
‎THE SCANDAL

18
00:02:37,657 --> 00:02:39,325
‎Because I wish to hold…

19
00:02:43,663 --> 00:02:46,166
‎a child that bears your likeness
‎in my arms.

20
00:02:48,209 --> 00:02:49,460
‎Do you still…

21
00:02:53,006 --> 00:02:55,675
‎hold me in your heart?

22
00:03:01,598 --> 00:03:02,432
‎Do you?

23
00:03:05,435 --> 00:03:06,436
‎Is that it?

24
00:03:10,607 --> 00:03:11,482
‎Madam.

25
00:03:12,233 --> 00:03:13,860
‎Madam, it is Gye-hwa.

26
00:03:14,569 --> 00:03:16,070
‎Pardon the intrusion.

27
00:03:32,629 --> 00:03:33,588
‎Madam.

28
00:03:33,671 --> 00:03:36,633
‎The Lady of the First Rank
‎has sent more medicinal herbs.

29
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:40,178
‎What shall we send in return?

30
00:03:40,261 --> 00:03:42,055
‎About the Left State Councilor's house.

31
00:03:43,389 --> 00:03:46,434
‎You know his eldest son suddenly died
‎a few years ago, do you not?

32
00:03:47,477 --> 00:03:49,395
‎As it happens, I crossed paths

33
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:52,023
‎with his young widow on my way to Hanyang.

34
00:03:52,649 --> 00:03:53,900
‎I saw her only briefly,

35
00:03:57,904 --> 00:04:01,199
‎yet she had a certain allure
‎that draws a man in.

36
00:04:02,825 --> 00:04:03,785
‎As though

37
00:04:04,369 --> 00:04:07,121
‎she were concealing
‎a deep sensuality beneath the surface.

38
00:04:07,205 --> 00:04:08,331
‎Is that so?

39
00:04:09,832 --> 00:04:12,210
‎You scoffed at the matter of So-ok,

40
00:04:12,293 --> 00:04:15,630
‎yet at the mention of a widow,
‎your eyes fairly light up.

41
00:04:19,968 --> 00:04:21,511
‎It is only natural, is it not?

42
00:04:22,553 --> 00:04:25,056
‎A woman of fate in full bloom

43
00:04:25,848 --> 00:04:28,810
‎is far more diverting
‎than some downy little girl.

44
00:04:30,979 --> 00:04:32,605
‎By your words alone,

45
00:04:32,689 --> 00:04:35,483
‎one would think you have already
‎held her in your arms.

46
00:04:50,540 --> 00:04:52,250
‎A widow like her?

47
00:04:56,838 --> 00:04:58,381
‎I could easily have her

48
00:04:58,965 --> 00:05:00,591
‎within the month.

49
00:05:01,551 --> 00:05:04,345
‎She has remained untouched
‎for more than 20 years.

50
00:05:05,388 --> 00:05:07,849
‎Are you saying you could so easily conquer

51
00:05:08,766 --> 00:05:11,644
‎a woman so fiercely protective
‎of her chastity?

52
00:05:12,937 --> 00:05:14,063
‎What is it

53
00:05:14,147 --> 00:05:15,523
‎you wish to see?

54
00:05:16,274 --> 00:05:17,525
‎Whatever do you mean?

55
00:05:18,651 --> 00:05:21,195
‎I merely fear
‎you may bring ruin upon yourself

56
00:05:21,279 --> 00:05:23,406
‎meddling with such a woman.

57
00:05:23,489 --> 00:05:26,075
‎She is the Left State Councilor's
‎daughter-in-law, after all.

58
00:05:31,205 --> 00:05:33,041
‎Let us forget the matter of So-ok,

59
00:05:33,833 --> 00:05:36,544
‎and you should put aside
‎these idle amusements as well.

60
00:05:37,128 --> 00:05:38,046
‎Idle amusements?

61
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:41,049
‎Could it be that

62
00:05:42,717 --> 00:05:44,469
‎you are jealous?

63
00:05:44,552 --> 00:05:46,637
‎I spoke only out of concern,

64
00:05:47,722 --> 00:05:49,307
‎yet that is how you took it?

65
00:05:49,891 --> 00:05:50,808
‎Indeed.

66
00:05:51,309 --> 00:05:53,603
‎I had meant to amuse myself a bit,
‎but you bid me stop.

67
00:05:54,437 --> 00:05:55,521
‎Now I find myself

68
00:05:57,106 --> 00:05:58,941
‎all the more intrigued.

69
00:06:00,193 --> 00:06:01,069
‎Oh, dear.

70
00:06:04,113 --> 00:06:05,740
‎Are you truly saying

71
00:06:06,532 --> 00:06:08,910
‎-you would pursue her even at such risk?
‎-Why?

72
00:06:09,952 --> 00:06:11,079
‎Do you doubt me?

73
00:06:11,954 --> 00:06:13,539
‎What will you do if I succeed?

74
00:06:13,623 --> 00:06:16,000
‎I plainly warned you against it,

75
00:06:16,084 --> 00:06:17,960
‎yet if you insist upon seeing it through…

76
00:06:21,964 --> 00:06:23,591
‎then I shall reward you.

77
00:06:24,342 --> 00:06:27,428
‎Whatever you desire.

78
00:06:30,098 --> 00:06:31,099
‎Whatever

79
00:06:32,725 --> 00:06:33,851
‎I desire?

80
00:06:46,864 --> 00:06:49,200
‎The only thing I desire is you.

81
00:06:50,326 --> 00:06:51,369
‎Surely you know

82
00:06:52,161 --> 00:06:53,913
‎that I have waited over a decade.

83
00:06:57,583 --> 00:06:58,918
‎Then can you

84
00:06:59,001 --> 00:07:02,964
‎write a heartfelt account
‎of the sound of that widow's door opening

85
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:05,633
‎after 20 long years?

86
00:07:07,844 --> 00:07:10,888
‎Can you prove it to me in writing?

87
00:07:21,816 --> 00:07:22,650
‎Yes.

88
00:07:27,613 --> 00:07:29,115
‎I could even stand before you

89
00:07:30,491 --> 00:07:32,493
‎and read it aloud.

90
00:07:35,288 --> 00:07:36,664
‎And if you fail,

91
00:07:37,999 --> 00:07:39,834
‎what will you give me?

92
00:07:43,337 --> 00:07:44,672
‎As you wish,

93
00:07:46,549 --> 00:07:48,926
‎I shall see that So-ok bears a child.

94
00:07:50,094 --> 00:07:52,305
‎Then we are agreed?

95
00:07:52,889 --> 00:07:53,890
‎We are…

96
00:07:56,225 --> 00:07:57,393
‎agreed.

97
00:08:05,693 --> 00:08:08,029
‎-We'll finish early, won't we?
‎-Yes, it's almost done.

98
00:08:16,412 --> 00:08:17,914
‎Oh, I heard you already!

99
00:08:18,581 --> 00:08:21,292
‎Damn it. She gets boiled meat?

100
00:08:21,375 --> 00:08:24,462
‎And nothing for the maid
‎who isn't pregnant. How unfair!

101
00:08:25,087 --> 00:08:27,965
‎-I'm dying for a bite of meat myself.
‎-Eun-sil!

102
00:08:28,508 --> 00:08:29,467
‎Eun-sil!

103
00:08:30,092 --> 00:08:32,094
‎We are leaving shortly!

104
00:08:32,178 --> 00:08:33,596
‎All right, I heard you!

105
00:08:41,354 --> 00:08:42,772
‎Oh, it's…

106
00:08:43,356 --> 00:08:44,607
‎It's nice to meet you.

107
00:08:44,690 --> 00:08:46,400
‎Is your name Eun-sil?

108
00:08:46,484 --> 00:08:48,194
‎That's a nice name.

109
00:08:48,277 --> 00:08:50,238
‎And your face is even nicer.

110
00:08:50,321 --> 00:08:51,447
‎Oh, my.

111
00:08:52,532 --> 00:08:54,951
‎What you have down there
‎is rather nice too.

112
00:08:57,203 --> 00:08:58,454
‎Yes, very nice.

113
00:09:03,668 --> 00:09:05,461
‎Get away from me, you filthy bum!

114
00:09:05,545 --> 00:09:06,712
‎No, wait…

115
00:09:06,796 --> 00:09:08,548
‎Wait! Listen.

116
00:09:08,631 --> 00:09:10,508
‎Are you craving meat?

117
00:09:16,514 --> 00:09:17,515
‎My lord!

118
00:09:18,933 --> 00:09:20,226
‎My lord.

119
00:09:22,019 --> 00:09:24,772
‎It seems she's craving meat. Good grief.

120
00:09:25,856 --> 00:09:26,899
‎Meat?

121
00:09:26,983 --> 00:09:27,817
‎Yes.

122
00:09:29,110 --> 00:09:30,319
‎You don't say.

123
00:09:30,403 --> 00:09:32,530
‎Meat while in mourning?

124
00:09:32,613 --> 00:09:33,531
‎I meant, Eun-sil.

125
00:09:34,782 --> 00:09:35,658
‎The lady's maid.

126
00:09:37,994 --> 00:09:39,495
‎-"Eun-sil"?
‎-Yes.

127
00:09:39,579 --> 00:09:41,706
‎-You have learned her name already?
‎-Yes.

128
00:09:43,708 --> 00:09:46,127
‎Thanks to you, my splendid master,

129
00:09:46,210 --> 00:09:48,879
‎I have tasted beef, pork,
‎every kind of meat there is.

130
00:09:48,963 --> 00:09:52,967
‎But other lowborn folk could never
‎even hope to get a bite of meat.

131
00:09:56,345 --> 00:09:57,179
‎Right?

132
00:10:00,266 --> 00:10:02,768
‎Find out where that girl Eun-sil has gone.

133
00:10:02,852 --> 00:10:03,686
‎Yes, sir.

134
00:10:33,424 --> 00:10:34,300
‎Here.

135
00:10:45,811 --> 00:10:46,812
‎All right.

136
00:10:51,233 --> 00:10:52,151
‎"I cannot…

137
00:10:53,778 --> 00:10:55,404
‎get you out of my mind, my lady."

138
00:10:56,781 --> 00:10:58,282
‎How's that, Chil-seong?

139
00:10:58,366 --> 00:10:59,283
‎Good.

140
00:10:59,367 --> 00:11:01,369
‎No, that won't do.

141
00:11:02,036 --> 00:11:04,330
‎"I cannot forget the moment

142
00:11:04,955 --> 00:11:05,915
‎I first

143
00:11:06,874 --> 00:11:07,917
‎laid eyes upon you."

144
00:11:08,417 --> 00:11:09,377
‎Isn't that better?

145
00:11:09,460 --> 00:11:10,878
‎Yes.

146
00:11:12,213 --> 00:11:13,047
‎All right.

147
00:11:19,428 --> 00:11:22,056
‎Hey, you fool. Keep still.

148
00:11:22,139 --> 00:11:23,974
‎Now I have ruined it.

149
00:11:25,434 --> 00:11:26,268
‎Again.

150
00:11:49,834 --> 00:11:51,001
‎My lady!

151
00:11:51,502 --> 00:11:54,004
‎Good heavens, look who it is!

152
00:11:54,672 --> 00:11:56,298
‎It has been far too long.

153
00:11:56,382 --> 00:11:57,258
‎Who might you be?

154
00:11:57,341 --> 00:12:00,386
‎I don't know from which family you come,
‎but I don't believe we have met.

155
00:12:00,469 --> 00:12:02,096
‎Do you not remember me?

156
00:12:02,179 --> 00:12:05,099
‎I am brother-in-law to Minister Yoo.

157
00:12:05,182 --> 00:12:07,393
‎My name is Cho Won.

158
00:12:07,977 --> 00:12:10,521
‎I thought I had seen you before
‎and wished to pay my respects.

159
00:12:10,604 --> 00:12:13,065
‎Forgive me
‎if I have made you uncomfortable.

160
00:12:13,149 --> 00:12:15,109
‎I do live near Minister Yoo's residence,

161
00:12:15,192 --> 00:12:18,487
‎so perhaps
‎we have seen each other in passing.

162
00:12:19,155 --> 00:12:22,616
‎Oh, are you
‎his wife's younger brother then?

163
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,452
‎Her cousin, in fact.

164
00:12:34,086 --> 00:12:37,423
‎I shall pay you a visit with her soon.

165
00:12:37,506 --> 00:12:38,674
‎Very well.

166
00:12:41,844 --> 00:12:42,678
‎My lady.

167
00:12:44,305 --> 00:12:45,890
‎My lady.

168
00:12:46,474 --> 00:12:47,475
‎Go.

169
00:12:48,058 --> 00:12:49,143
‎-Take this.
‎-What is it?

170
00:12:49,226 --> 00:12:50,186
‎A letter.

171
00:12:50,269 --> 00:12:52,104
‎-You can read and write too?
‎-Just go.

172
00:13:15,169 --> 00:13:16,128
‎My lady.

173
00:13:17,046 --> 00:13:18,297
‎My sincerest condolences.

174
00:13:19,048 --> 00:13:20,049
‎Thank you.

175
00:13:20,925 --> 00:13:21,800
‎Oh, yes.

176
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:25,471
‎Earlier today, I met the gentleman
‎who is said to be your cousin.

177
00:13:26,347 --> 00:13:27,223
‎Pardon?

178
00:13:27,306 --> 00:13:30,351
‎I had long heard
‎much about him, of course.

179
00:13:30,434 --> 00:13:33,521
‎But even at a glance,
‎his beauty was striking enough

180
00:13:33,604 --> 00:13:36,398
‎to make it plain he shares your blood.

181
00:13:36,482 --> 00:13:38,734
‎You flatter us.

182
00:13:39,693 --> 00:13:40,528
‎Please.

183
00:14:20,025 --> 00:14:21,026
‎Young Master Geum-ho…

184
00:14:23,237 --> 00:14:26,240
‎Forgive me.
‎I still call him that out of habit.

185
00:14:30,619 --> 00:14:32,329
‎This belonged to your late husband.

186
00:14:36,250 --> 00:14:41,130
‎He often came to read
‎in our study annex while he was alive.

187
00:14:41,755 --> 00:14:45,009
‎I believe this is a copy
‎he transcribed himself then.

188
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:47,595
‎Go on, open it.

189
00:15:10,576 --> 00:15:14,872
‎You can feel both his bold spirit
‎and steadfast character, can you not?

190
00:15:19,251 --> 00:15:20,377
‎Would you

191
00:15:20,878 --> 00:15:22,796
‎please tell me

192
00:15:23,839 --> 00:15:26,467
‎what sort of man he was?

193
00:15:33,807 --> 00:15:35,184
‎He was

194
00:15:36,143 --> 00:15:38,854
‎truly a remarkable young man.

195
00:15:40,189 --> 00:15:43,400
‎Hardly a day passed without the sound
‎of his reading drifting over the wall,

196
00:15:43,901 --> 00:15:47,071
‎and the elders of his family
‎placed great hopes upon him.

197
00:15:48,238 --> 00:15:50,574
‎I heard he was unmatched
‎among countless scholars

198
00:15:50,658 --> 00:15:53,035
‎even in the initial
‎civil service examination.

199
00:15:55,496 --> 00:15:56,455
‎But

200
00:15:57,831 --> 00:16:01,961
‎what I remember most is not any of that.

201
00:16:02,670 --> 00:16:05,172
‎It is the gentle sight of him

202
00:16:05,881 --> 00:16:09,259
‎quietly catching
‎a falling flower in his hand

203
00:16:10,052 --> 00:16:12,137
‎and admiring it.

204
00:16:14,264 --> 00:16:17,184
‎He studied with eyes full of curiosity,

205
00:16:17,893 --> 00:16:22,439
‎always gazing warmly upon the world
‎as it bloomed and faded

206
00:16:24,108 --> 00:16:26,360
‎with each passing season.

207
00:16:27,236 --> 00:16:28,904
‎That is what I remember.

208
00:16:54,138 --> 00:16:55,848
‎-Wait.
‎-Let us go. Quickly.

209
00:16:55,931 --> 00:16:57,141
‎Bun-hui.

210
00:16:57,224 --> 00:16:58,308
‎-Let us go.
‎-Huh?

211
00:16:59,018 --> 00:16:59,852
‎Bun-hui.

212
00:17:00,894 --> 00:17:01,770
‎Bun-hui!

213
00:17:02,271 --> 00:17:03,147
‎Wait.

214
00:17:04,690 --> 00:17:07,401
‎Look at you. How long has it been?

215
00:17:08,068 --> 00:17:08,902
‎Huh?

216
00:17:10,696 --> 00:17:11,905
‎Why the familiarity?

217
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:15,409
‎Come now, I am only glad to see you.

218
00:17:18,787 --> 00:17:20,831
‎So, have you been well all this while?

219
00:17:20,914 --> 00:17:22,875
‎Well? Bun-hui.

220
00:17:26,462 --> 00:17:27,337
‎I have lived

221
00:17:28,964 --> 00:17:30,758
‎all these years

222
00:17:31,842 --> 00:17:34,136
‎unable to forget the scent

223
00:17:34,678 --> 00:17:36,513
‎you once drenched me in.

224
00:17:38,515 --> 00:17:39,349
‎Step aside.

225
00:17:39,433 --> 00:17:41,185
‎Come now, Bun-hui.

226
00:17:41,268 --> 00:17:42,603
‎You are here.

227
00:17:43,187 --> 00:17:44,605
‎Oh, my lord.

228
00:17:44,688 --> 00:17:47,524
‎This is the mother of the lady
‎who is to become Lord Yoo's concubine.

229
00:17:48,192 --> 00:17:49,359
‎"My lord"?

230
00:17:49,985 --> 00:17:51,862
‎Wait, that means…

231
00:17:53,197 --> 00:17:55,699
‎My brother-in-law's concubine…

232
00:17:56,325 --> 00:17:57,367
‎You are her mother?

233
00:17:57,993 --> 00:18:00,037
‎"Brother-in-law"?

234
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:05,375
‎"Brother-in-law," you say?

235
00:18:05,459 --> 00:18:07,503
‎So then you are So-ok's mother…

236
00:18:08,587 --> 00:18:09,463
‎"Brother-in-law"?

237
00:18:11,006 --> 00:18:11,840
‎Wait…

238
00:18:18,222 --> 00:18:19,723
‎That wretched man.

239
00:18:21,350 --> 00:18:22,601
‎He's driving me mad.

240
00:18:35,114 --> 00:18:36,490
‎She is

241
00:18:37,991 --> 00:18:39,409
‎no ordinary girl, that one.

242
00:18:40,577 --> 00:18:41,411
‎Chil-seong!

243
00:18:41,495 --> 00:18:42,996
‎-Chil-seong!
‎-Yes?

244
00:18:43,914 --> 00:18:46,917
‎Fan it harder!

245
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:47,835
‎Oh, yes.

246
00:18:51,046 --> 00:18:54,091
‎The meat melts in the mouth!

247
00:18:55,050 --> 00:18:56,552
‎It sure does!

248
00:18:56,635 --> 00:18:58,053
‎How delicious!

249
00:18:58,137 --> 00:18:58,971
‎It's delicious!

250
00:19:03,684 --> 00:19:05,102
‎Just wait.

251
00:19:05,185 --> 00:19:06,854
‎The girl was mad for meat.

252
00:19:07,771 --> 00:19:08,772
‎She will come.

253
00:19:31,461 --> 00:19:34,381
‎Surely she will come before the sun sets.

254
00:19:42,931 --> 00:19:43,849
‎Could I…

255
00:19:48,187 --> 00:19:49,521
‎Eun-sil.

256
00:19:53,692 --> 00:19:54,568
‎Let me.

257
00:20:00,199 --> 00:20:01,992
‎Give it here. Careful now.

258
00:20:03,118 --> 00:20:04,745
‎Water.

259
00:20:10,334 --> 00:20:11,835
‎Wash it down as you eat.

260
00:20:13,670 --> 00:20:16,256
‎I won't take it from you.
‎I only fear you might choke.

261
00:20:25,015 --> 00:20:28,602
‎But why are you letting me eat
‎such fine meat?

262
00:20:28,685 --> 00:20:30,854
‎I may be a lowly servant,

263
00:20:30,938 --> 00:20:33,690
‎but even I know
‎nothing in this world is free.

264
00:20:34,274 --> 00:20:37,110
‎Did she read the letter at once?

265
00:20:38,862 --> 00:20:39,821
‎The letter?

266
00:20:40,656 --> 00:20:42,991
‎I have it safely right here.

267
00:20:43,742 --> 00:20:46,370
‎Wait, why would you…

268
00:20:46,954 --> 00:20:48,956
‎Hey, was it not meant for me?

269
00:20:50,749 --> 00:20:53,126
‎Oh, dear. The meat is burning.

270
00:20:53,210 --> 00:20:55,754
‎I… I will go get it.

271
00:20:57,631 --> 00:21:00,259
‎Such fine meat! Yes.

272
00:21:01,760 --> 00:21:02,636
‎So,

273
00:21:03,136 --> 00:21:05,138
‎how much longer until the mourning ends?

274
00:21:05,722 --> 00:21:07,099
‎About a fortnight.

275
00:21:07,975 --> 00:21:11,436
‎Once that passes, it will all be over.

276
00:21:11,520 --> 00:21:13,772
‎My, this looks delicious.

277
00:21:13,855 --> 00:21:15,732
‎But isn't that a good thing if it ends?

278
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:18,735
‎Your lady can't even eat good food
‎during mourning.

279
00:21:18,819 --> 00:21:20,529
‎Have you never heard of a virtuous woman?

280
00:21:21,154 --> 00:21:23,198
‎-No.
‎-She ought to follow her husband in death.

281
00:21:26,660 --> 00:21:27,911
‎You know nothing.

282
00:21:32,165 --> 00:21:33,750
‎I did not know.

283
00:21:50,851 --> 00:21:52,060
‎Watch carefully.

284
00:21:53,020 --> 00:21:55,522
‎I shall teach you each step.

285
00:21:56,857 --> 00:21:57,691
‎Yes.

286
00:21:57,774 --> 00:22:00,110
‎Two more baskets are coming, sister.

287
00:22:00,193 --> 00:22:01,862
‎All right, hurry them over.

288
00:22:16,918 --> 00:22:18,170
‎Are you occupied?

289
00:22:18,670 --> 00:22:20,630
‎There is no end to what must be taught

290
00:22:20,714 --> 00:22:22,716
‎to one joining the household.

291
00:22:22,799 --> 00:22:25,344
‎Oh, this is the girl
‎who is to be taken in as a concubine.

292
00:22:25,927 --> 00:22:27,054
‎Her name is So-ok.

293
00:22:29,306 --> 00:22:31,892
‎Greetings, my lord.

294
00:22:33,393 --> 00:22:34,561
‎Pleased to meet you.

295
00:22:42,194 --> 00:22:44,654
‎I hear you paid a visit to that widow.

296
00:22:49,201 --> 00:22:51,453
‎Did you speak ill of me or something?

297
00:22:51,536 --> 00:22:54,372
‎In our library, I just happened to find

298
00:22:55,040 --> 00:22:59,002
‎a notebook once used by her late husband,
‎Young Master Geum-ho.

299
00:23:00,128 --> 00:23:02,255
‎I went to deliver it

300
00:23:02,339 --> 00:23:05,092
‎and had a nice little chat with her.

301
00:23:06,927 --> 00:23:07,844
‎You happened to find

302
00:23:09,262 --> 00:23:10,430
‎his notebook, did you?

303
00:23:10,514 --> 00:23:15,310
‎She begged me to tell her
‎all there was to know of her husband.

304
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:18,980
‎After I shared what I could remember,

305
00:23:19,064 --> 00:23:23,902
‎she gazed upon that notebook
‎with such admiration.

306
00:23:25,445 --> 00:23:26,863
‎I wish

307
00:23:27,614 --> 00:23:30,242
‎you had been there
‎to see the look in her eyes.

308
00:23:31,284 --> 00:23:32,661
‎To imagine her

309
00:23:32,744 --> 00:23:36,581
‎looking upon me with those same eyes,
‎begging for my love…

310
00:23:38,125 --> 00:23:42,087
‎I dare say my dreams tonight
‎shall be sweet and exciting.

311
00:23:44,923 --> 00:23:48,260
‎Since you are so full of confidence,
‎I suppose I need not worry.

312
00:23:48,969 --> 00:23:52,931
‎But first, you will need
‎to thoroughly erase the husband

313
00:23:53,515 --> 00:23:56,226
‎who still occupies that widow's mind.

314
00:23:56,309 --> 00:23:58,770
‎It is no matter, for the man is a ghost.

315
00:23:59,271 --> 00:24:01,940
‎Can such a thing rival
‎a flesh-and-blood man

316
00:24:02,023 --> 00:24:04,151
‎rooted firmly in this world?

317
00:24:04,818 --> 00:24:07,404
‎She longs for him
‎only because she never saw him.

318
00:24:07,487 --> 00:24:10,699
‎Once she faces a real man,
‎she would be quick to fall into his arms.

319
00:24:11,616 --> 00:24:12,659
‎And you believe

320
00:24:13,785 --> 00:24:17,831
‎that alone will suddenly
‎give her the courage to withstand

321
00:24:18,957 --> 00:24:20,917
‎the countless eyes and ears of Bukchon?

322
00:24:23,795 --> 00:24:26,339
‎When one comes to love
‎with all one's being…

323
00:24:29,342 --> 00:24:31,803
‎such obstacles become meaningless.

324
00:24:33,180 --> 00:24:34,389
‎Surely

325
00:24:35,599 --> 00:24:37,309
‎you know that as well.

326
00:24:42,564 --> 00:24:43,440
‎I…

327
00:24:45,650 --> 00:24:47,277
‎can be such a man.

328
00:24:47,360 --> 00:24:48,278
‎And I shall gladly

329
00:24:50,113 --> 00:24:52,324
‎be such a man for that lady.

330
00:24:55,619 --> 00:24:56,536
‎Now,

331
00:24:57,787 --> 00:24:59,122
‎the ghost's name is

332
00:24:59,956 --> 00:25:01,374
‎Geum-ho, is it?

333
00:25:03,335 --> 00:25:04,252
‎Madam.

334
00:25:09,382 --> 00:25:12,219
‎Visitors have arrived
‎from the Left State Councilor's house.

335
00:25:36,368 --> 00:25:38,370
‎My lady, do you remember me?

336
00:25:39,120 --> 00:25:42,290
‎I am In-ho, who went to study
‎among the Confucian scholars of Andong.

337
00:25:43,625 --> 00:25:45,710
‎Why, can that young boy

338
00:25:45,794 --> 00:25:48,088
‎truly have grown so much?

339
00:25:49,881 --> 00:25:51,007
‎Have you been well?

340
00:25:57,430 --> 00:25:58,515
‎How do you do?

341
00:25:58,598 --> 00:26:00,892
‎I am the youngest son
‎of the Left State Councilor,

342
00:26:00,976 --> 00:26:02,310
‎Kwon In-ho.

343
00:26:02,394 --> 00:26:04,646
‎I am brother-in-law to Minister Yoo,

344
00:26:05,313 --> 00:26:06,606
‎Cho Won.

345
00:26:08,566 --> 00:26:09,401
‎Might you be

346
00:26:09,985 --> 00:26:12,904
‎the Scholar Cho Won,
‎whose essay on the southern sacred herb

347
00:26:13,905 --> 00:26:15,448
‎at the civil service examination

348
00:26:16,032 --> 00:26:17,450
‎won such renown back then?

349
00:26:17,534 --> 00:26:19,786
‎You flatter me with talk of renown.

350
00:26:19,869 --> 00:26:22,414
‎It was merely good fortune,

351
00:26:22,497 --> 00:26:24,457
‎thanks to a fine literary friend of mine.

352
00:26:24,541 --> 00:26:25,917
‎It is an honor to meet you.

353
00:26:26,418 --> 00:26:29,546
‎Not only I,
‎but even the friends with whom I study,

354
00:26:29,629 --> 00:26:31,256
‎have long wished to read your writings.

355
00:26:31,339 --> 00:26:34,175
‎We have a volume of his scholarly writings
‎in the study annex.

356
00:26:34,926 --> 00:26:36,219
‎Why don't you two scholars

357
00:26:36,303 --> 00:26:40,432
‎look through it together
‎and have a thoughtful discussion?

358
00:26:42,183 --> 00:26:43,101
‎Very well.

359
00:26:44,019 --> 00:26:45,854
‎Come with me, my lady.

360
00:26:46,521 --> 00:26:50,650
‎Let us women share
‎some trivial secrets in the meantime.

361
00:26:51,234 --> 00:26:52,068
‎Let me.

362
00:27:01,786 --> 00:27:02,996
‎Shall we?

363
00:27:10,962 --> 00:27:14,174
‎My mother-in-law
‎wished to repay you for finding

364
00:27:14,758 --> 00:27:16,384
‎my husband's belongings.

365
00:27:16,968 --> 00:27:18,762
‎She had meant to come herself,

366
00:27:20,305 --> 00:27:22,474
‎but I told her I wished to see you

367
00:27:23,224 --> 00:27:24,976
‎and asked if I could come in her stead.

368
00:27:25,560 --> 00:27:29,314
‎I only hope this sudden visit
‎has not been discourteous.

369
00:27:29,397 --> 00:27:31,858
‎I could only be grateful.

370
00:27:33,318 --> 00:27:36,988
‎In truth, I have been
‎quite eager to see you myself.

371
00:27:39,908 --> 00:27:41,159
‎How sweet of you.

372
00:27:46,748 --> 00:27:47,791
‎It is exactly the same.

373
00:27:48,375 --> 00:27:49,334
‎Just as I remember it.

374
00:27:49,417 --> 00:27:51,002
‎Did you visit often?

375
00:27:52,712 --> 00:27:54,506
‎I used to come here with my elder brother.

376
00:27:55,799 --> 00:27:57,384
‎They have every book imaginable.

377
00:27:59,302 --> 00:28:00,220
‎In fact,

378
00:28:00,303 --> 00:28:04,599
‎it was my brother
‎who first told me of you, sir.

379
00:28:07,477 --> 00:28:08,436
‎Is that so?

380
00:28:08,520 --> 00:28:12,315
‎He said, "Within his writings lie
‎not only the truths of learning,

381
00:28:12,399 --> 00:28:15,026
‎but also the joys and sorrows of life."

382
00:28:15,652 --> 00:28:18,696
‎Sadly, before I, with my shallow learning,

383
00:28:19,364 --> 00:28:21,616
‎could fully understand what he meant…

384
00:28:24,411 --> 00:28:26,955
‎The peonies have bloomed beautifully,
‎have they not?

385
00:28:28,498 --> 00:28:30,750
‎Yes, indeed. They are quite lovely.

386
00:28:30,834 --> 00:28:32,752
‎My husband's new concubine

387
00:28:33,795 --> 00:28:35,171
‎is very much like them.

388
00:28:37,048 --> 00:28:39,426
‎Look, Mal-ttong! There are flowers here!

389
00:28:39,509 --> 00:28:41,302
‎Such a lovely girl.

390
00:28:42,220 --> 00:28:43,388
‎Careful, Miss!

391
00:28:43,471 --> 00:28:45,056
‎Just like a peony,

392
00:28:45,724 --> 00:28:47,642
‎she carries a rosy smile

393
00:28:48,226 --> 00:28:52,397
‎and fills every corner of this house
‎with the fragrance of flowers.

394
00:28:58,737 --> 00:29:01,239
‎What of your younger days?

395
00:29:01,322 --> 00:29:03,992
‎You too must have been so very beautiful.

396
00:29:11,291 --> 00:29:13,460
‎I thought having a husband and serving him

397
00:29:13,543 --> 00:29:15,462
‎would be the joy of the rest of my life.

398
00:29:19,591 --> 00:29:21,092
‎Once my marriage was arranged,

399
00:29:22,385 --> 00:29:25,638
‎my heart began to flutter,
‎as if I had finally become a grown woman.

400
00:29:30,560 --> 00:29:32,103
‎You asked earlier

401
00:29:32,854 --> 00:29:35,440
‎why I wrote such an answer
‎at the palace examination.

402
00:29:36,858 --> 00:29:37,692
‎Well,

403
00:29:38,443 --> 00:29:40,612
‎your brother saw straight through it.

404
00:29:42,864 --> 00:29:44,073
‎At the time…

405
00:29:46,785 --> 00:29:50,705
‎I was burdened with
‎more than a man of my age ought to bear.

406
00:29:50,789 --> 00:29:53,291
‎There was once a man I loved.

407
00:29:55,043 --> 00:29:57,837
‎But ours was a bond
‎meant to be fulfilled only in death.

408
00:29:58,338 --> 00:30:00,548
‎Joy, anger, sorrow, delight.

409
00:30:01,758 --> 00:30:04,010
‎I lived through them all indeed.

410
00:30:05,637 --> 00:30:09,682
‎And so I poured every feeling
‎life had stirred in me into that essay.

411
00:30:09,766 --> 00:30:11,476
‎Yet whenever I feel lonely,

412
00:30:13,186 --> 00:30:15,271
‎I find myself thinking of him.

413
00:30:15,855 --> 00:30:17,023
‎It feels as though

414
00:30:18,274 --> 00:30:21,027
‎he might come rushing in
‎and open my door at any moment

415
00:30:21,110 --> 00:30:23,321
‎if only I said I missed him.

416
00:30:36,793 --> 00:30:38,169
‎I wish to entrust

417
00:30:39,087 --> 00:30:40,547
‎this secret of mine to this petal

418
00:30:40,630 --> 00:30:42,882
‎and offer it to you
‎as a token of friendship.

419
00:30:44,384 --> 00:30:47,512
‎Should you ever find yourself
‎in need of help, come to me.

420
00:30:48,638 --> 00:30:49,556
‎And next time,

421
00:30:50,431 --> 00:30:53,476
‎I hope you will share
‎your own heart with me as well.

422
00:31:20,712 --> 00:31:24,299
‎You will not find anyone
‎more tight-lipped than me.

423
00:31:28,553 --> 00:31:29,596
‎The truth is…

424
00:31:34,809 --> 00:31:38,771
‎Oh, my goodness!

425
00:31:46,279 --> 00:31:48,781
‎Until now, I thought
‎pheasant was the finest thing there was,

426
00:31:48,865 --> 00:31:51,034
‎but now my mind has changed completely.

427
00:31:53,036 --> 00:31:54,829
‎Right? Beef is the best, huh?

428
00:31:56,080 --> 00:31:59,792
‎Pheasant does not even come close.

429
00:32:04,213 --> 00:32:06,132
‎I do not know what is written here…

430
00:32:10,929 --> 00:32:13,014
‎but these letters are truly beautiful.

431
00:32:14,891 --> 00:32:15,767
‎Especially

432
00:32:17,685 --> 00:32:18,645
‎this one.

433
00:32:19,812 --> 00:32:20,730
‎Is it?

434
00:32:25,109 --> 00:32:26,653
‎I hope it's a son.

435
00:32:30,073 --> 00:32:31,199
‎Then I shall have him

436
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:33,576
‎learn his letters too.

437
00:32:38,539 --> 00:32:40,667
‎This is called an alarm clock.

438
00:32:40,750 --> 00:32:43,419
‎My father brought it back
‎from the Great State.

439
00:32:43,503 --> 00:32:45,964
‎What? Come on, it is not even food.

440
00:32:46,631 --> 00:32:48,132
‎-What is it for?
‎-You.

441
00:32:48,716 --> 00:32:51,135
‎I told you to mind your tone
‎with me, did I not?

442
00:32:51,219 --> 00:32:52,720
‎What is it for, miss?

443
00:32:55,473 --> 00:32:57,725
‎It tells the time.

444
00:32:58,518 --> 00:33:00,144
‎These needle-like things

445
00:33:00,228 --> 00:33:03,982
‎go round and round all day long
‎and show the time.

446
00:33:04,565 --> 00:33:06,401
‎-What?
‎-It is a rare treasure

447
00:33:06,484 --> 00:33:08,736
‎you would go your whole lives
‎without ever laying eyes on

448
00:33:08,820 --> 00:33:10,488
‎if it weren't for me.

449
00:33:10,571 --> 00:33:12,073
‎Thanks to me, you get to see one.

450
00:33:12,156 --> 00:33:13,116
‎Nice, is it not?

451
00:33:14,450 --> 00:33:15,535
‎Hey, where are you going?

452
00:33:15,618 --> 00:33:16,703
‎I'm not finished…

453
00:33:20,498 --> 00:33:22,291
‎What are you doing here?

454
00:33:22,917 --> 00:33:24,002
‎Well, I…

455
00:33:25,712 --> 00:33:27,714
‎Goodness,
‎this is a most precious treasure.

456
00:33:27,797 --> 00:33:29,674
‎How could you handle it so carelessly?

457
00:33:31,384 --> 00:33:33,011
‎Is that an alarm clock?

458
00:33:33,678 --> 00:33:34,929
‎I've only read of it in books.

459
00:33:35,680 --> 00:33:37,265
‎This is my first time seeing one.

460
00:33:37,348 --> 00:33:40,143
‎Truly, there is nothing
‎Lord Yoo's house doesn't possess.

461
00:33:46,315 --> 00:33:47,525
‎If you

462
00:33:49,068 --> 00:33:50,153
‎turn it like this…

463
00:34:02,832 --> 00:34:03,875
‎Hey!

464
00:34:10,882 --> 00:34:12,759
‎I thought heaven and earth
‎were splitting apart.

465
00:34:13,384 --> 00:34:14,719
‎How can it make such a noise?

466
00:34:16,262 --> 00:34:17,263
‎Please come along now.

467
00:34:29,650 --> 00:34:30,485
‎My apologies.

468
00:34:37,283 --> 00:34:38,117
‎That way.

469
00:35:08,439 --> 00:35:10,817
‎I just saw your palanquin leaving.

470
00:35:11,984 --> 00:35:13,069
‎Who was inside?

471
00:35:17,240 --> 00:35:18,282
‎Cousin.

472
00:35:18,866 --> 00:35:20,076
‎That day…

473
00:35:21,536 --> 00:35:23,287
‎The day you would have

474
00:35:24,747 --> 00:35:27,250
‎waited endlessly for me
‎at the ferry landing.

475
00:35:30,878 --> 00:35:32,964
‎I can only imagine how much pain…

476
00:35:36,384 --> 00:35:37,760
‎you must have been in that day.

477
00:35:59,532 --> 00:36:00,783
‎And what of you that day?

478
00:36:14,422 --> 00:36:16,591
‎Hurry and follow the palanquin.

479
00:36:17,967 --> 00:36:20,595
‎The one inside
‎may prove most beneficial to you.

480
00:36:24,307 --> 00:36:25,975
‎Do you speak of the widow?

481
00:36:31,397 --> 00:36:33,357
‎Are you helping me…

482
00:36:40,072 --> 00:36:42,241
‎out of remorse for the past?

483
00:36:44,535 --> 00:36:47,413
‎Let us say I simply feel too lonely today.

484
00:36:48,623 --> 00:36:49,624
‎Now, go.

485
00:36:50,374 --> 00:36:51,792
‎Before you lose her.

486
00:36:54,170 --> 00:36:56,172
‎The more I know you…

487
00:37:04,305 --> 00:37:06,140
‎the more unknowable you seem.

488
00:37:24,492 --> 00:37:25,952
‎A marriage proposal sent for you.

489
00:37:27,745 --> 00:37:30,081
‎It is from Yoo Hong-sang,
‎a junior academic official.

490
00:37:31,540 --> 00:37:32,959
‎Now, this family

491
00:37:33,542 --> 00:37:36,087
‎would not scold a woman
‎for being bold enough

492
00:37:36,170 --> 00:37:37,922
‎to read proper script.

493
00:37:38,005 --> 00:37:40,258
‎They are men
‎with the confidence and generosity

494
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:43,010
‎to exchange and recite verses
‎with their wives,

495
00:37:43,719 --> 00:37:45,346
‎and live out their days

496
00:37:45,888 --> 00:37:48,224
‎in perfect harmony.

497
00:38:08,077 --> 00:38:09,412
‎MUN-HEUL

498
00:38:09,495 --> 00:38:10,997
‎Take it.

499
00:38:11,080 --> 00:38:12,123
‎What do you mean to do?

500
00:38:12,206 --> 00:38:14,125
‎-I am leaving tomorrow.
‎-Miss Yun!

501
00:38:14,208 --> 00:38:15,918
‎That is why you must deliver it.

502
00:38:16,002 --> 00:38:18,129
‎So we do not pass each other by. Please?

503
00:38:43,654 --> 00:38:44,488
‎Won,

504
00:38:44,989 --> 00:38:48,701
‎perhaps I am a woman
‎who longs for love after all.

505
00:38:49,702 --> 00:38:52,204
‎Even now,
‎as marriage talks pass between families,

506
00:38:53,122 --> 00:38:55,499
‎my eyes, my hands,

507
00:38:56,208 --> 00:38:58,919
‎and my heart search only for you.

508
00:39:00,796 --> 00:39:02,173
‎So I ask this of you.

509
00:39:03,132 --> 00:39:05,384
‎Where my sorrowful tears have pooled,

510
00:39:05,926 --> 00:39:07,803
‎I shall ready a lonely boat.

511
00:39:08,387 --> 00:39:10,389
‎Will you please wait for me there?

512
00:39:11,599 --> 00:39:14,143
‎I will come to you.

513
00:39:41,170 --> 00:39:42,213
‎Father.

514
00:39:44,215 --> 00:39:45,466
‎Oh, Yun.

515
00:39:46,133 --> 00:39:47,843
‎What brings you out at this hour?

516
00:39:49,678 --> 00:39:52,723
‎Father, may I ask why you are in tears?

517
00:39:58,521 --> 00:40:00,064
‎Because it is such a waste.

518
00:40:01,315 --> 00:40:05,152
‎Had you been born a man, you'd have taken
‎top honors in the civil service exam.

519
00:40:07,655 --> 00:40:09,448
‎If only you were not a woman…

520
00:40:13,786 --> 00:40:16,539
‎you would have had many chances
‎to make your name known.

521
00:40:18,374 --> 00:40:21,710
‎But now that even your marriage
‎has been arranged,

522
00:40:22,920 --> 00:40:24,046
‎how many more times

523
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:28,676
‎shall I see your face before I die?

524
00:41:58,766 --> 00:42:01,227
‎Let us proceed with the bowing.

525
00:42:07,358 --> 00:42:09,527
‎The groom shall answer with one bow.

526
00:42:20,746 --> 00:42:23,415
‎Now, the wedding vows.

527
00:42:51,026 --> 00:42:53,279
‎My dear Kkot-bun! Come here!

528
00:42:54,238 --> 00:42:56,407
‎-Come here, you!
‎-Come here.

529
00:42:57,658 --> 00:42:59,577
‎Over here!

530
00:43:04,873 --> 00:43:05,916
‎Young master.

531
00:43:06,792 --> 00:43:08,168
‎Do you remember me?

532
00:43:10,170 --> 00:43:11,505
‎I did not recognize you.

533
00:43:11,589 --> 00:43:13,924
‎-Missus!
‎-Your garments are ready, sir.

534
00:43:14,008 --> 00:43:14,883
‎Missus!

535
00:43:16,552 --> 00:43:17,386
‎Missus.

536
00:43:22,474 --> 00:43:23,934
‎Mend my garment for me.

537
00:43:27,229 --> 00:43:28,063
‎Here.

538
00:43:40,826 --> 00:43:42,703
‎All right, this arm first.

539
00:43:44,830 --> 00:43:45,664
‎Oh, dear.

540
00:43:48,751 --> 00:43:51,003
‎Forgive my carelessness, young master.

541
00:43:51,086 --> 00:43:53,047
‎I shall alter it to fit you properly.

542
00:43:55,215 --> 00:43:57,343
‎I must have been mistaken.

543
00:43:58,135 --> 00:44:00,179
‎No, the fault is not yours.

544
00:44:00,763 --> 00:44:02,514
‎I simply have grown since then.

545
00:44:03,807 --> 00:44:04,642
‎Young master.

546
00:44:06,685 --> 00:44:09,146
‎If I may ask, why were you

547
00:44:09,229 --> 00:44:11,649
‎standing by the river
‎with such sorrowful eyes?

548
00:44:13,734 --> 00:44:15,486
‎What makes you say so?

549
00:44:20,699 --> 00:44:22,409
‎The traces of your tears

550
00:44:22,993 --> 00:44:24,536
‎were still glistening.

551
00:44:26,580 --> 00:44:27,998
‎The woman I love

552
00:44:29,375 --> 00:44:30,626
‎has left me.

553
00:44:33,962 --> 00:44:35,047
‎Sir.

554
00:44:35,631 --> 00:44:38,509
‎Tears will not bring her back.

555
00:44:40,302 --> 00:44:41,303
‎Do you still see

556
00:44:43,138 --> 00:44:45,849
‎traces of tears upon my face?

557
00:44:48,727 --> 00:44:50,020
‎Missus!

558
00:44:54,233 --> 00:44:55,526
‎Missus!

559
00:44:56,652 --> 00:44:57,736
‎Hand me the mirror.

560
00:44:57,820 --> 00:44:59,363
‎Is my garment done yet?

561
00:45:11,542 --> 00:45:14,336
‎Missus, do you have any tobacco left?

562
00:45:14,920 --> 00:45:16,255
‎How impatient you are!

563
00:46:01,717 --> 00:46:02,593
‎Cousin.

564
00:46:11,768 --> 00:46:13,520
‎Would you look at this gentleman?

565
00:46:14,563 --> 00:46:15,481
‎That tickles!

566
00:46:23,322 --> 00:46:24,156
‎How…

567
00:46:25,491 --> 00:46:26,700
‎How are you

568
00:46:27,993 --> 00:46:29,953
‎so beautiful?

569
00:47:29,555 --> 00:47:31,640
‎Wait! Wait just a moment!

570
00:47:32,391 --> 00:47:34,518
‎Why are you in such haste?

571
00:51:04,311 --> 00:51:09,316
‎Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song
